:"Tbh I think Man united have a bad season. They have the same back 4 that they had in 2022. Luke Shaw as the starting LB in 2026 doesn\u0027t work with 2 games a week. I wouldn\u0027t put them higher than 6th tbh. Carrick is a yes man manager which is why you\u0027ve not signed anyone. You don\u0027t keep possession and you have no runners in midfield apart from Santos.\n\nAs a Spurs fan our season is going to depend on our attacking signings in the next few weeks. As far as midfield and defence I\u0027m happy.\n\nGive me Savinho, Gakpo and Mikautadze and I\u0027m putting us at 4th. Add a RB into that and I\u0027m delighted with our window.","author":{"@type":"https://schema.org/Person","name":"@gsampson97","url":"https://www.youtube.com/@gsampson97","alternateName":"George Sampson"},"upvoteCount":14}]}</script><script nonce="zUNzgpvztwTd29cG23qn5A">if (window.ytcsi) {window.ytcsi.tick('bc', null, '');}var ytimg={count:0,preload:function(src){var img=new Image;var count=++ytimg.count;ytimg[count]=img;img.onload=img.onerror=function(){delete ytimg[count]};img.src=src}};
