3558618},{"key":"3120000","value":2573558618},{"key":"3130000","value":2573558102},{"key":"3140000","value":2569233721},{"key":"3150000","value":2573556557},{"key":"3160000","value":2573558351},{"key":"3170000","value":2569233723},{"key":"3180000","value":2569692478},{"key":"3190000","value":2573556300},{"key":"3200000","value":2569233722},{"key":"3210000","value":2573555787},{"key":"3220000","value":2573557070},{"key":"3230000","value":2575259923},{"key":"3240000","value":2574406952},{"key":"3250000","value":2574407460}]}}}],"microformat":{"microformatDataRenderer":{"videoDetails":{"comments":[{"type":"https://schema.org/Comment","dateCreated":"2026-08-16T03:01:12-07:00","text":"Tbh I think Man united have a bad season. They have the same back 4 that they had in 2022. Luke Shaw as the starting LB in 2026 doesn't work with 2 games a week. I wouldn't put them higher than 6th tbh. Carrick is a yes man manager which is why you've not signed anyone. You don't keep possession and you have no runners in midfield apart from Santos.\n\nAs a Spurs fan our season is going to depend on our attacking signings in the next few weeks. As far as midfield and defence I'm happy.\n\nGive me Savinho, Gakpo and Mikautadze and I'm putting us at 4th. Add a RB into that and I'm delighted with our window.","author":{"type":"https://schema.org/Person","name":"@gsampson97","url":"https://www.youtube.com/@gsampson97","alternateName":"George Sampson"},"upvoteCount":14}]}}},"frameworkUpdates":{"entityBatchUpdate":{"mutations":[{"entityKey":"EgZ0b3BiYXIg9QEoAQ%3D%3D","type":"ENTITY_MUTATION_TYPE_DELETE","options":{"persistenceOption":"ENTITY_PERSISTENCE_OPTION_INMEMORY_AND_PERSIST"}},{"entityKey":"EhxsaWtlX2J1dHRvbl9hbmltYXRpb25fZW50aXR5ILcEKAE%3D","type":"ENTITY_MUTATION_TYPE_REPLACE","payload":{"likeButtonAnimationEntity":{"key":"EhxsaWtlX2J1dHRvbl9hbmltYXRpb25fZW50aXR5ILcEKAE%3D","animationLightUrl":"https://www.gstatic.com/youtube/img/lottie/custom_animated_like_icon/animated_like_soccer_ligh